  "CardDescription": {
    "ParentObjectID": "act_iron_lode",
    "LocalizationKey": "Advanced_Copper_Tools_IronLode_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "A collapsed seam of iron ore, heaped under fallen rock. Clear the rubble with a pickaxe, shovel, axe, antler or knife (eighteen hard shifts), and it becomes a mother lode that never runs out. Mine it slowly with a pickaxe, or chip away with an axe, hammer, shovel or antler."
  },
